# `build.cycle_collector` (plans/backlog/WEAK_AND_UNCOLLECTED_RC.md §1, W1):
# the Executable field reaches the child compile as `--cycle-collector off`.
# The probe's own line is the comparable output: tracked and collected under
# the default, untracked and leaked under `Off`. The "Building" lines name the
# host binary (`.exe` on Windows), so they are not kept.
stdout_keep=^(cycle: |Error|error:)
timeout=900
